          "id": "greeting",
          "type": "npc",
          "character": "fenne",
          "content": "嘿，新来的冒险者！欢迎来到石洼落。",
          "delay": 0,
          "next": "intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "intro",
          "type": "npc",
          "character": "fenne",
          "content": "这里虽然是个小村子，但通往各个界域的冒险都从这里开始。",
          "delay": 1500,
          "next": "choice-1"
        },
        {
          "id": "choice-1",
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "能告诉我更多关于这个世界的事吗？",
              "next": "world-info",
              "favorability": 5
            },
            {
              "text": "有什么任务可以做吗？",
              "next": "quest-info",
              "favorability": 0
            },
            {
              "text": "我先四处看看。",
              "next": "farewell",
              "favorability": 0
